    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/785c1f5919ca0ab48042c73f83bf6832.avif?t=1753737711\" width=800 height=97 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/9b0e4bdaef115d80f03740faad781542.poster.avif?t=1753737711\" width=540 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/9b0e4bdaef115d80f03740faad781542.webm?t=1753737711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/9b0e4bdaef115d80f03740faad781542.mp4?t=1753737711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktank</strong> is a cozy idle aquarium that lives right on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the charm of idle games like <i>Rusty\u2019s Retirement</i>, Desktank brings a peaceful underwater world to your screen \u2014 whether you\u2019re working, browsing, or just taking a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide how you want to experience it:<br>\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Keep it tucked in the corner like a cute screen companion,<br>\ud83c\udf0a Or let it float freely across your whole desktop for a full aquarium takeover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/581276335d412e474259dab062607699.poster.avif?t=1753737711\" width=640 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/581276335d412e474259dab062607699.webm?t=1753737711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/581276335d412e474259dab062607699.mp4?t=1753737711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc1f Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Aquarium Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Fish swim, grow, and interact while you focus on other things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Integration</strong> \u2013 Always-on-top mode lets your tank float over your workspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Fish</strong> \u2013 Change fish colors and styles to create your perfect underwater vibe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Ecosystem</strong> \u2013 Watch your tank come alive with fish behaviors and interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peaceful &amp; Non-Intrusive</strong> \u2013 No stress, no pressure \u2014 just ambient chill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Customizable View</strong> \u2013 Resize, position, and theme your aquarium to match your mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/e2d390ac49e836a0c031658a45f5cbc6.poster.avif?t=1753737711\" width=540 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/e2d390ac49e836a0c031658a45f5cbc6.webm?t=1753737711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/e2d390ac49e836a0c031658a45f5cbc6.mp4?t=1753737711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/785c1f5919ca0ab48042c73f83bf6832.avif?t=1753737711\" width=800 height=97 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/9b0e4bdaef115d80f03740faad781542.poster.avif?t=1753737711\" width=540 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/9b0e4bdaef115d80f03740faad781542.webm?t=1753737711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/9b0e4bdaef115d80f03740faad781542.mp4?t=1753737711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktank</strong> is a cozy idle aquarium that lives right on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the charm of idle games like <i>Rusty\u2019s Retirement</i>, Desktank brings a peaceful underwater world to your screen \u2014 whether you\u2019re working, browsing, or just taking a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide how you want to experience it:<br>\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Keep it tucked in the corner like a cute screen companion,<br>\ud83c\udf0a Or let it float freely across your whole desktop for a full aquarium takeover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/581276335d412e474259dab062607699.poster.avif?t=1753737711\" width=640 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/581276335d412e474259dab062607699.webm?t=1753737711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/581276335d412e474259dab062607699.mp4?t=1753737711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc1f Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Aquarium Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Fish swim, grow, and interact while you focus on other things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Integration</strong> \u2013 Always-on-top mode lets your tank float over your workspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Fish</strong> \u2013 Change fish colors and styles to create your perfect underwater vibe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Ecosystem</strong> \u2013 Watch your tank come alive with fish behaviors and interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peaceful &amp; Non-Intrusive</strong> \u2013 No stress, no pressure \u2014 just ambient chill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Customizable View</strong> \u2013 Resize, position, and theme your aquarium to match your mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/e2d390ac49e836a0c031658a45f5cbc6.poster.avif?t=1753737711\" width=540 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/e2d390ac49e836a0c031658a45f5cbc6.webm?t=1753737711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/e2d390ac49e836a0c031658a45f5cbc6.mp4?t=1753737711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
